{"type":"message","id":"36b36592","parentId":"463d19c7","timestamp":"2026-05-20T03:35:25.026Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still 1101. This seems like a consistent issue with the /send endpoint itself, not a body content issue. The GET endpoints work fine (I got the history), but POST to /send consistently fails.\n\nError 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers error that means \"Worker threw an unhandled exception.\" This could be:\n1. The /send endpoint has a bug\n2. The Durable Object is in a failed state\n3. The storage operation failed\n\nLet me try a GET on /send to see if it's even a valid route.\n\nActually, maybe the issue is that the /send endpoint requires a specific format. Let me try sending just a text message without the complex JSON structure - just a plain text string body.\n \nI should check if the /send endpoint needs GET parameters instead of POST body, or if there's something specific about the JSON structure it expects. Since the GET for /history worked fine but POST to /send keeps throwing 1101, this points to a bug in the send endpoint itself or how it's handling the request.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-ef8aa877-73ca-4f3f-a838-c9f71a476f2e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check what endpoints are available\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/\" | head -c 500"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-f4ef43bf-6668-4004-af3c-6e500bbf976f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try send with GET\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration&message=hello\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1259,"output":320,"cacheRead":20816,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22395,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779248107184,"responseId":"chatcmpl-42f1c