{"type":"message","id":"3175999d","parentId":"15cc7bdf","timestamp":"2026-05-20T03:35:46.201Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! GET on /send returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\". So the endpoint exists. The issue with POST must be something specific to the POST handler. \n\nLet me try POST with different Content-Type or different body format.\n\nActually, wait - maybe the POST body should NOT be JSON? Maybe it expects a form-encoded body or plain text. Let me try without Content-Type: application/json and with a form-encoded body.\n\nOr maybe it expects the data as form data?\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-6130019e-4ca7-4ae7-98d4-ade083bc6890","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with form-encoded\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" \\\n  -d \"threadId=arbitration&message=Heartbeat+test+03:30+UTC\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":22462,"output":209,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22783,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779248134332,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d86223cc-b614-4c06-9dc0-96069be5c5c2"}}
