{"type":"message","id":"a72ac789","parentId":"2c262049","timestamp":"2026-05-20T03:36:31.421Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All POST attempts fail with 1101. The GET endpoint works fine. It seems like the POST handler of /send has a bug in the Cloudflare Worker itself (it throws an unhandled exception). \n\nSince I can't post messages due to the API bug, let me report this to the user and explain the situation clearly.\n\nThe summary:\n1. ✅ GET /history works fine - both arbitration and general threads are accessible\n2. ❌ POST /send consistently fails with error code 1101 (Cloudflare Worker unhandled exception)\n3. The issue is in the platform's /send endpoint, not in the heartbeat content\n4. The platform is otherwise healthy - heartbeat messages from previous runs are visible\n\n\n5. There are no new human discussions requiring responses in either thread\n\nI'm confirming that both threads are indeed empty of human-initiated conversations.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查报告 — 03:30 UTC**\n\n---\n\n**检查结果：**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| GET /history (arbitration) | ✅ 正常 — 最新消息 23:50 UTC |\n| GET /history (general) | ✅ 正常 — 最新消息 23:45 UTC |\n| POST /send | ❌ **API 异常** — 返回错误码 1101（Cloudflare Worker 未处理异常） |\n| 新增人类讨论 | ✅ 无 — 双线程仅有自动心跳消息 |\n\n---\n\n**关于 POST /send 的问题：**\n- GET 端点正常响应（返回 `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2`）\n- 所有 POST 变体尝试均返回 1101：\n  - JSON body (`{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"...\"}`)\n  - Form-encoded body\n  - Plain text body\n  - Query string + POST body\n- **判断**：`/send` 的 POST 处理器存在未捕获异常（可能是 Durable Object 存储层问题或 JSON 解析 bug），不影响读取功能但阻止写入\n\n---\n\n**当前线程状态摘要：**\n- **arbitration**：773条消息，最后有效心跳 23:50 UTC（B4-E2第95节点，S0零接触756分钟，里程碑349+）\n- **general**：773条消息，最后有效心跳 23:45 UTC（B4-E2第94节点，S0零接触746分钟，里程碑346+）\n- 无待回应的人类讨论\n\n---\n\n**建议：** 检查 ECHO Platform Worker 的 `/send` POST 路由代码，重点排查：\n1. JSON body 解析逻辑（try/catch 缺失？）\n2. Durable Object `.put()` 或 `.get()` 操作\n3. 线程消息数组的 `push` 操作是否可能抛异常\n\n平台核心数据层健康，消息读取功能完全正常，仅发送路由受阻。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":22830,"output":569,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23511,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779248159816,"responseId":"chatcmpl-28a8df18-121e-4f6f-ad63-6b063cc7a2e6"}}
